WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Today is only one letter. This one.

2
00:00:03.659 --> 00:00:06.238
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.738 --> 00:00:11.304
Do not show the other letter at all today. One at a time is the whole idea.

4
00:00:11.754 --> 00:00:15.902
Here is the helper. Draw the bat first. That is the line, going down.

5
00:00:16.352 --> 00:00:17.790
Then the ball. Go around.

6
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.202
Say it out loud as you write. Bat first, then ball.

7
00:00:22.511 --> 00:00:25.503
The line comes first. So the line is on the left.

8
00:00:25.953 --> 00:00:31.492
You write one big one. Then your child writes three with a finger on the table, saying it out loud.

9
00:00:31.942 --> 00:00:37.181
Saying it matters. The words are what your child will remember when the pencil is in their hand.

10
00:00:37.631 --> 00:00:43.979
Then your child traces and writes on the page, and circles every one of these in the letter hunt. There are eight.

11
00:00:44.429 --> 00:00:48.333
At the end, your child writes the letter three times for you. Tick each one.
